timeline.body:
Strings.toString isn't the thing to use here. It will create a builder internally, but you already have a builder.

When not specified, the builder creates a ByteArrayOutputStream. You can use it like this:
```
var stream = (ByteArrayOutputStream) bodyBuilder.getOutputStream();
String body = stream.toString(StandardCharsets.UTF_8);
```

